# Photographic merging. Machine-assisted translation with terminology review.
photo_merge.title = Fotow fara ɲɔgɔn kan...
photo_merge.align = Alignment otomatiki (otomatiki) la
photo_merge.focus = Aw bɛ fotow fara ɲɔgɔn kan ni u ɲɛsincogo yɔrɔjanw tɛ kelen ye
photo_merge.hdr = HDR ka bɔ jiracogo caman na
photo_merge.panorama = Aw bɛ fotow fara ɲɔgɔn kan ka kɛ panorama ye
photo_merge.translation = Ja lamagacogo tilennen ni jɔlen dɔrɔn (X/Y); jiginni walima filɛlicogo latilenni tɛ.
photo_merge.crop = Sɛnɛfɛnw ka taa yɔrɔ jɛlen na
